Lean unicode abbreviations
==========================

abbreviations.json is the table of Lean's unicode input (`\forall` -> `∀`),
redistributed unmodified from the official Lean 4 VS Code extension:

  https://github.com/leanprover/vscode-lean4
  lean4-unicode-input/src/abbreviations.json, commit dead846a035f42dc13beb7619ac779538e6ddf6e

